# Machine-specific Hyprland config.
#
# Copy to local.conf and put anything that belongs to YOUR machine here --
# extra keybinds, per-device workarounds, window rules for software only you
# run. local.conf is git-ignored, so it survives updates and never ships to
# other SumiNami users.
#
# Sourced last, so anything here overrides the defaults.
#
# Example -- swallow Ctrl/Shift + middle-click so an evdev-level autoclicker
# reads the button without the focused window also seeing it:
#
#   bind = CTRL, mouse:274, exec, true
#   bind = SHIFT, mouse:274, exec, true
